21:["$","p","Keep the exact owner announcement with your planning notes and recheck it before starting the form. This review did not establish a precise closing hour, time zone or course commencement date for your eventual offer. The country instructions also warn that a high-volume country can close early. Use the actual notice and portal for your route instead of assuming you can safely wait until the end of a generic month-long range.",{"children":"Keep the exact owner announcement with your planning notes and recheck it before starting the form. This review did not establish a precise closing hour, time zone or course commencement date for your eventual offer. The country instructions also warn that a high-volume country can close early. Use the actual notice and portal for your route instead of assuming you can safely wait until the end of a generic month-long range."}]
