24:["$","figure",null,{"className":"page-visual day15-guide-visual page-visual--inline","children":[["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/day15/research-library-1280.webp","srcSet":"/images/day15/research-library-640.webp 640w, /images/day15/research-library-1280.webp 1280w","sizes":"(max-width: 860px) calc(100vw - 32px), 440px","width":1280,"height":853,"alt":"Illustrative scene of a student comparing a book and written research notes","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy"}],["$","figcaption",null,{"children":"Illustrative study scene. The people and setting do not represent this scholarship or university."}]]}]
25:["$","article",null,{"className":"article-body article-body--guide","children":[null,["$","section","1-Country comes before course popularity",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Country comes before course popularity"}],[["$","p","The published Asian citizenship list contains Cambodia, Indonesia, Lao PDR, Malaysia, Nepal, Philippines, Thailand, Timor-Leste and Viet Nam. Pakistan is not on that list. Within the Asian degree list, undergraduate study is limited to Timor-Leste; the availability of postgraduate routes does not create an undergraduate route for every eligible Asian citizen.",{"children":"The published Asian citizenship list contains Cambodia, Indonesia, Lao PDR, Malaysia, Nepal, Philippines, Thailand, Timor-Leste and Viet Nam. Pakistan is not on that list. Within the Asian degree list, undergraduate study is limited to Timor-Leste; the availability of postgraduate routes does not create an undergraduate route for every eligible Asian citizen."}],["$","p","Consider three fictional checks. An Indonesian applicant researching a master’s starts with a listed country and an available degree level, but still has other criteria to satisfy. An Indonesian applicant seeking a bachelor’s cannot copy Timor-Leste’s undergraduate route. A Pakistani citizen finding an attractive university course has not passed this Manaaki citizenship gate. Keep a negative result visible and research another award rather than changing the country or degree description to force a match.",{"children":"Consider three fictional checks. An Indonesian applicant researching a master’s starts with a listed country and an available degree level, but still has other criteria to satisfy. An Indonesian applicant seeking a bachelor’s cannot copy Timor-Leste’s undergraduate route. A Pakistani citizen finding an attractive university course has not passed this Manaaki citizenship gate. Keep a negative result visible and research another award rather than changing the country or degree description to force a match."}]],"$undefined",[["$","p",null,{"className":"table-scroll-hint","children":"On a small screen, scroll the table sideways to compare all columns."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"guide-table-wrap","role":"region","aria-label":"Original country-and-level decision examples","tabIndex":0,"children":["$","table",null,{"className":"guide-table","children":[["$","caption",null,{"children":"Original country-and-level decision examples"}],["$","thead",null,{"children":["$","tr",null,{"children":[[["$","th","Fictional starting point",{"scope":"col","children":"Fictional starting point"}],["$","th","Result at this gate",{"scope":"col","children":"Result at this gate"}],["$","th","What it does not establish",{"scope":"col","children":"What it does not establish"}]],"$undefined"]}]}],["$","tbody",null,{"children":[["$","tr","0",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Indonesia + master’s"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Country and level appear in the published Asian scope"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"Residence, work, subject fit or selection"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","1",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Indonesia + bachelor’s"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Do not use the Timor-Leste-only undergraduate route"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"A university admission offer cannot remove the restriction"}]],"$undefined"]}],["$","tr","2",{"children":[[["$","th","0",{"scope":"row","children":"Pakistan + any course"}],["$","td","1",{"children":"Country absent from this reviewed eligible-country list"}],["$","td","2",{"children":"General international admission is a different question"}]],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}]}],"$undefined"],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",["$L29"]]}],"$undefined"]}],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d"]}]
